@api = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Kiem tra may chu dang chay -> 200 OK
GET {{api}}/

### 2. Danh sach bai tap -> 200 OK
GET {{api}}/api/assignments

### 3. Chi tiet bai tap 1 -> 200 OK
GET {{api}}/api/assignments/1

### 4. Bai tap khong ton tai -> 404 ASSIGNMENT_NOT_FOUND
GET {{api}}/api/assignments/999

### 5. Nop bai cho bai tap 1 -> 201 Created + Location
# @name createSubmission
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV001",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv001/rest-api"
}

### 6. Doc lai luot nop vua tao -> 200 OK
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### 7. Nop bai thieu thong tin -> 400 INVALID_SUBMISSION
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "",
  "repositoryUrl": ""
}

### 8. Luot nop khong ton tai -> 404 SUBMISSION_NOT_FOUND
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

